{"id":"vrode","lemma":"вроде","pos":"prep","rank":240,"glosses":["like, such as, kind of, not unlike, similar to"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/23/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ненавижу людей вроде тебя.","en":"I hate people like you.","words":[{"g":"to hate","l":"ненавидеть"},{"g":"people, humans","l":"люди"},null,{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"Мы об этом вроде уже говорили.","en":"I thought we talked about this already.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"about"},null,null,{"g":"already"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"}]},{"text":"Вам сегодня вроде получше.","en":"You look like you're feeling better today.","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},{"g":"today"},null,null]},{"text":"Том вроде хороший человек.","en":"Tom seems like a good person.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"good, nice, fine"},{"g":"person"}]},{"text":"Мне вроде нравится.","en":"I think I like it.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"to like","l":"нравиться"}]}]}